{"version":1,"key":"quest:63","content":{"id":63,"title":"field-sizing 是什么？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:63","type":"quest","id":63},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"field-sizing 让表单元素随内容自适应尺寸","meta":"","excerpt":"field-sizing 属性可以控制表单元素的大小，在一般情况下表单元素的大小是固定的，例如对于 input 元素，如果内容超出了宽度，那么内容会横向滚动，对于 textarea 元素，我们设定了 rows，超出 rows 后也会发生滚动，而 field-sizing 可以设置为元素大小适应内容，跟随内容而自动调整尺","target":{"key":"card:653","type":"card","id":653},"citeKey":"card:653"}],"trail":[{"time":1746880927113,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1767161127861,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1767161127866,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"createTime":1746880927113,"updateTime":1746880927113,"resolvedTime":1767161127866},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1746880927113}}